WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:03.720
It was almost time for cooking class.

2
00:00:03.721 --> 00:00:07.803
The kids were talking outside the kitchen door.

3
00:00:07.804 --> 00:00:12.048
"I wonder what we're cooking today," Nina said.

4
00:00:12.049 --> 00:00:18.978
"It can't be as good as what I ate last night!" Bobby patted his stomach.

5
00:00:18.979 --> 00:00:22.840
"What was that?" Jason asked.

6
00:00:22.841 --> 00:00:27.483
"My grandfather took me to a baseball game," Bobby said.

7
00:00:27.484 --> 00:00:34.486
"I ate two hot dogs, a hamburger, and some pepperoni pizza!"

8
00:00:34.487 --> 00:00:39.848
"Whoa! I could never eat all that!" Izzie said.

9
00:00:39.849 --> 00:00:42.621
Bobby made a muscle with his arm.

10
00:00:42.622 --> 00:00:50.587
"I'm growing, so I need to eat a lot."

11
00:00:50.612 --> 00:00:56.371
Inside, the kids washed their hands and put on their aprons.

12
00:00:56.372 --> 00:01:01.041
"This is one of my favorite vegetarian meals," Chef said.

13
00:01:01.042 --> 00:01:04.196
"Sesame noodles with tofu."

14
00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:10.023
Bobby looked surprised. "You're a vegetarian, Chef?"

15
00:01:10.024 --> 00:01:15.787
"No," Chef said. "But I eat meatless meals several times a week.

16
00:01:15.788 --> 00:01:18.265
This dish is quick and easy.

17
00:01:18.266 --> 00:01:22.431
But we have to prepare everything first."

18
00:01:22.432 --> 00:01:25.604
Izzie filled a pot with water for the noodles.

19
00:01:25.605 --> 00:01:30.848
She put it on the stove and turned on the heat.

20
00:01:30.849 --> 00:01:34.034
Jason made the sauce.

21
00:01:34.035 --> 00:01:40.587
He poured soy sauce, sesame oil, and rice vinegar into a bowl.

22
00:01:40.588 --> 00:01:45.554
Then he added ginger, garlic powder, and black pepper.

23
00:01:45.555 --> 00:01:48.842
He mixed everything together.

24
00:01:48.843 --> 00:01:54.720
Izzie chopped green onions, and Nina peeled and grated a carrot.

25
00:01:54.721 --> 00:01:59.002
Bobby drained the water from the tofu package.

26
00:01:59.003 --> 00:02:08.246
"Tofu falls apart easily," Chef said. "So treat it gently."

27
00:02:08.247 --> 00:02:13.170
Bobby carefully removed the block of tofu.

28
00:02:13.171 --> 00:02:17.607
He cut it into small cubes and sprinkled them with salt.

29
00:02:17.608 --> 00:02:22.245
"We made chocolate tofu pudding with Miss Shelly," he said.

30
00:02:22.246 --> 00:02:25.591
"But I don't know where tofu comes from."

31
00:02:25.592 --> 00:02:32.253
"I know!" Nina said. "It's made from soybeans."

32
00:02:32.254 --> 00:02:35.575
Chef poured some cooking oil into a pan.

33
00:02:35.576 --> 00:02:40.668
When it was hot, he stir-fried the cubes of tofu.

34
00:02:40.669 --> 00:02:44.532
"Eating plants is okay," Bobby said.

35
00:02:44.533 --> 00:02:48.073
"But at my house we eat meat every day.

36
00:02:48.074 --> 00:02:51.683
Meat helps you grow strong."

37
00:02:51.684 --> 00:02:55.753
"Yes, meat has lots of protein," Chef said.

38
00:02:55.754 --> 00:03:00.836
"But you can get protein from tofu, beans, and nuts too.

39
00:03:00.837 --> 00:03:04.240
Oh, good. Our tofu is golden brown.

40
00:03:04.241 --> 00:03:07.244
That means it's ready."

41
00:03:07.245 --> 00:03:09.484
Jason checked the water.

42
00:03:09.485 --> 00:03:11.582
The water was boiling.

43
00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:14.467
He put the noodles in to cook.

44
00:03:14.468 --> 00:03:18.181
"I read a book about being a vegetarian," he said.

45
00:03:18.182 --> 00:03:20.976
"It helps the planet."

46
00:03:20.977 --> 00:03:26.267
Chef nodded. "Cows and other livestock produce greenhouse gases.

47
00:03:26.268 --> 00:03:28.981
Those heat up the planet.

48
00:03:28.982 --> 00:03:32.960
And it takes a lot of land to raise animals."

49
00:03:32.961 --> 00:03:37.490
"But vegetables grow in fields too," Bobby said.

50
00:03:37.491 --> 00:03:41.712
"Farmers need land to grow crops, don't they?"

51
00:03:41.713 --> 00:03:45.195
"Of course," Izzie said.

52
00:03:45.196 --> 00:03:49.707
"But it takes a lot of land to raise animals."

53
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:54.864
Bobby started laughing.

54
00:03:54.865 --> 00:03:59.270
"I think everyone wants me to be a vegetarian!"

55
00:03:59.271 --> 00:04:03.964
Nina shrugged. "You can eat different dishes.

56
00:04:03.965 --> 00:04:07.941
Some with meat and some without."

57
00:04:07.942 --> 00:04:12.784
Chef checked the noodles. "They're ready!"

58
00:04:12.785 --> 00:04:15.603
The kids got bowls.

59
00:04:15.604 --> 00:04:19.721
Chef gave everyone a helping of noodles.

60
00:04:19.722 --> 00:04:23.310
"Now you can add tofu and vegetables."

61
00:04:23.311 --> 00:04:26.603
The kids put some tofu on top of the noodles.

62
00:04:26.604 --> 00:04:29.926
Then they added the green onions and carrot.

63
00:04:29.927 --> 00:04:36.043
Finally they poured on some sauce.

64
00:04:36.044 --> 00:04:38.825
Bobby started eating.

65
00:04:38.826 --> 00:04:41.415
"The sauce is great!

66
00:04:41.416 --> 00:04:44.415
And the tofu is good too!"

67
00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:48.654
"As good as pepperoni pizza?" Jason asked.

68
00:04:48.655 --> 00:04:57.215
Bobby grinned. "They're both good."

